#. +> trunk stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:58
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<title>RCPS Scheduler</title>"
"<para>The Resource Constrained Project Scheduler (RCPS) focuses on scheduling the project to avoid overbooking resources. It still respects task dependencies and also tries to fullfill time constraints. However, time constraints can make it very difficult to find a good solution, so it may be preferable to use a different scheduler in these cases.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>RCPS-Planer</title>"
"<para>De ressourcenafhangig Projektplaner (Resource Constrained Project Scheduler, \"RCPS\") schall in de Hööftsaak dat Överboken vun Ressourcen verhöden. De passt man ok noch op Opgavenafhangigkeiten op un höllt wenn mööglich ok Tietbedingen in. Mennigmaal is wegen de Tietbedingen de Bruuk vun en anner Planer anraadt.</para>"

#. +> stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:67
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Scheduling backwards from target end time is not supported."
msgstr "Planen vun Opgaven vun de Enntiet af warrt nich ünnerstütt."

#. +> stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:68
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "The project will be scheduled forward from target start time."
msgstr "Dat Projekt warrt vun de plaante Starttiet af vörut plaant."

#. +> stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:72
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Scheduling tasks with time constraints is not supported."
msgstr "Planen vun Opgaven mit Tietbedingen warrt nich ünnerstütt."

#. +> stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:73 KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:78
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Tasks will be scheduled As Soon As Possible (ASAP)."
msgstr "Opgaven warrt \"As fröh as mööglich\" plaant."

#. +> stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:77
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Scheduling tasks As Late As Possible (ALAP) is not supported."
msgstr "Planen vun Opgaven \"As laat as mööglich\" warrt nich ünnerstütt."

#. +> stable
#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:92
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "<b>This scheduler does not support all the requested scheduling functionality.</b>"
msgstr "<b>Disse Planer ünnerstütt nich all nödig Funkschonen.</b>"

